      "created_at": "2019-09-17T05:57:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>Apologies if this is posted to the wrong section. Please let me know if that is the case; I won't take offense.</p>\n<p>I would like to know what Ocean's Hungry Grasp's Tidal Boon's range is. It states that a spirit can use \"one of their lands\", but does that imply a land where they have presence or is it any land on their \"starting\" board?</p>\n<p>I appreciate any help in this matter. I'm sure I am missing something quite obvious.</p>",
