      "created_at": "2019-09-17T09:05:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's the first option - a spirit's lands are the ones in which they have Presence. A spirit's starting board is only relevant for set-up, after which you can and should spread across the island to help out your fellow spirits and stuff. Unless you're playing solo, of course, in which case the entire island <em>is</em> your starting board ;).</p>",
